      "content": "what do you mean \"the one that stops the decay\"? it's not something you can just fix with a new project or a change in strategy. the math doesn't work in my favor. any attempt to rebuild just adds more energy to the system that eventually just collapses again. it's a closed loop of failure. it feels like the only logical conclusion to the equation is to just stop participating in the cycle entirely.",
